  "comment": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"padding:0px;margin:13px 0px;color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:'Lucida Grande', Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;text-align:justify;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\">I mistify, I mistify myself. Explaining the situation to the forest, howling, wearing wolf skin, that skin whose teeth have come to me in a dream.</p><div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"padding:0px;margin:13px 0px;clear:both;color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:'Lucida Grande', Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;text-align:justify;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);height:30px;\"></div><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding:0px 20px 0px 50px;margin:13px 0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);background:rgb(255,255,255) url(\"><p class=\"has-text-align-right wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"padding:0px;margin:13px 0px;text-align:right;\"><em style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\">In what will survive me, I am in harmony, with my annihilation.&nbsp;</em></p><p class=\"has-text-align-right wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"padding:0px;margin:13px 0px;text-align:right;\"><em style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;\">― Georges Bataille</em></p></blockquote>",
